# Airbnb Price Prediction Model

## 📌 Overview
This project aims to develop a data-driven pricing model for Airbnb listings by analyzing key factors that influence listing prices. The goal is to provide actionable insights for hosts to optimize their pricing strategies and maximize revenue.

---

## 🎯 Objective
- Predict Airbnb listing prices based on property, location, and host-related features
- Identify the most important factors driving price differences

---

## 🧠 Methodology
- Data Cleaning & Preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Feature Engineering
- Regression Modeling (Python)
- Model Evaluation

---

## 📊 Key Insights
- 📍 **Location is the strongest driver of price**, especially proximity to city centers
- 🏠 **Property type and room type significantly impact pricing**
- ⭐ Listings with higher review scores and better host profiles tend to command premium prices
- 📈 The model can be used as a reference tool for **dynamic pricing strategies**

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies
- Python (pandas, numpy)
- scikit-learn
- Regression Analysis
- Data Visualization (matplotlib, seaborn)

---

## 💼 Business Implications
- Helps Airbnb hosts set competitive prices
- Supports platform-level pricing recommendations
- Can be extended into a real-time pricing optimization system

---

## 📁 File
- `airbnb_price_prediction.ipynb`: Full analysis and model development
